1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,406
Can I Try Another Size?

3
00:00:03,406 --> 00:00:07,229
Dad takes me shopping for new sneakers because my old ones are getting tight.

4
00:00:07,229 --> 00:00:10,844
At the store, I find a purple pair with bright yellow laces.

5
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:13,073
They're exactly the colors I wanted.

6
00:00:13,348 --> 00:00:15,465
What size do you usually wear?

7
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,579
A six, I think.

8
00:00:17,579 --> 00:00:20,933
The clerk brings a box, and I sit down to try them on.

9
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:22,558
They look amazing.

10
00:00:22,558 --> 00:00:25,360
My toes do not seem as excited as I am.

11
00:00:25,636 --> 00:00:27,168
How do they feel?

12
00:00:27,388 --> 00:00:29,153
These feel a little tight.

13
00:00:29,153 --> 00:00:31,819
Maybe they'll be okay if I don't move much.

14
00:00:32,092 --> 00:00:34,344
That could be a problem for shoes.

15
00:00:34,564 --> 00:00:36,506
We can try half a size up.

16
00:00:36,506 --> 00:00:38,776
You should be able to walk comfortably.

17
00:00:39,052 --> 00:00:40,900
Can I try another size?

18
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:44,660
The clerk brings the bigger pair, and I put both shoes on this time.

19
00:00:44,932 --> 00:00:46,530
Take a few steps.

20
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:49,561
See if your heel stays in place and your toes have room.

21
00:00:49,828 --> 00:00:51,957
I walk toward the mirror and back.

22
00:00:51,957 --> 00:00:53,311
Much better.

23
00:00:53,311 --> 00:00:56,186
I can actually imagine running for the bus in these.

24
00:00:56,452 --> 00:00:59,506
Hopefully, we'll leave early enough that you won't need to.

25
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:03,213
At the counter, the clerk asks if I want to wear them out of the store.

26
00:01:03,213 --> 00:01:06,171
I say yes and put my old shoes in the box.

27
00:01:06,436 --> 00:01:07,594
Ready?

28
00:01:07,828 --> 00:01:09,186
More than ready.

29
00:01:09,186 --> 00:01:11,718
I take one big, comfortable step.

30
00:01:11,718 --> 00:01:13,718
The yellow laces bounce.

31
00:01:13,718 --> 00:01:16,478
My toes and I have finally agreed on something.
